        "TileImage": "$($repository 7edbb420-0ea6-4b42-a110-2f65b356dc0d).Image",
        "Description": "Good Afternoon 47. Your targets today are Marty Ducksvally, Stephen Hampshire, and Donald Christopher. They have been seen conversing late at night near the frog habitat and have been heard to talk about their &quot;latest escapade&quot; with their mistresses. I shall leave it to you to see they won&apos;t cheat death as they did their wives.\r\rI shall leave you to prepare, and as always, Good Luck.",
